  {
    "id": "polonius-despair-full-log",
    "source": "<b>Polonius:</b> <indent=16%>Howl, howl, howl, howl...\nShe's gone forever.\nI know when one is dead and when one lives.\nShe's dead as earth. Lend me a looking-glass!\nIf that her breath will mist or stain the stone—\nWhy then, she lives.\nLook on her. Look, her lips. Look there, look there.\nOh... oh... oh...</indent>\n<b>Ophelia:</b> <indent=16%>He wasn't in his right mind. Not at the end.</indent>",
    "target": "<b>波洛涅斯:</b> <indent=16%>哭吧，哭吧，哭吧，哭吧……\n她永远地走了。\n一个人是死是活，我分得清。\n她像泥土一样，毫无生气。借我一面镜子！\n要是她的气息能让镜面蒙上雾气，留下痕迹——\n那她就还活着。\n看看她。看，她的嘴唇。看那里，看那里。\n哦……哦……哦……</indent>\n<b>奥菲莉娅:</b> <indent=16%>到最后，他已经神志不清了。</indent>",
